{
 "version": 1,
 "name": "greenhouse",
 "archetype": "building.greenhouse",
 "description": "A garden greenhouse with its door at the +Z gable: a brick base wall with a concrete floor and path, an aluminium frame of studs, sills, eaves and transoms with glass side walls, a gable roof (glass slopes, rafters and a ridge bar) or an arched roof (a curved glass shell on hoops), glazed gable ends, a sliding glass door on a track, hinged roof vents that open about the ridge, and staging with a shelf and potted plants along one side.",
